
# Company Landing Page

A professional and responsive company landing page
built using HTML5 and CSS3.

## Project Structure

company-website/
│
├── index.html
├── style.css
├── Dockerfile
├── Jenkinsfile
└── README.md

## Technologies Used

- HTML5
- CSS3
- Docker
- Nginx
- Jenkins
- CI/CD Pipeline

## Website Features

1. Professional Navigation Bar
2. Hero Section
3. About Us Section
4. Three Services Cards
5. Why Choose Us Section
6. Contact Section
7. Professional Footer
8. Responsive Design
9. CSS Hover Effects

## Run Locally

1. Clone the repository:

   git clone <your-repository-url>

2. Navigate to the project directory:

   cd company-website

3. Open index.html in your browser.

## Run Using Docker

Build Docker image:

docker build -t company-website .

Run Docker container:

docker run -d -p 8080:80 --name company-landing-page company-website

Open in browser:

http://localhost:8080

## Jenkins CI/CD Setup

1. Install Jenkins.
2. Install Docker on the Jenkins agent.
3. Ensure Jenkins has permission to execute Docker commands.
4. Push this project to a Git repository.
5. Create a new Pipeline job in Jenkins.
6. Configure the Git repository.
7. Select Pipeline script from SCM.
8. Choose Git as SCM.
9. Set the Script Path to Jenkinsfile.
10. Save and click Build Now.

## Deployment

The Jenkins pipeline performs:

1. Source code checkout.
2. Docker image creation.
3. Old container removal.
4. New container deployment.

Application URL:

http://localhost:8080

